<title>POLAND: POLISH TRADER BEST TO START BOURSE TRADE MAY 30.</title>
<headline>POLISH TRADER BEST TO START BOURSE TRADE MAY 30.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish trader BEST SA will start trade on the Warsaw bourse's main market on May 30, bourse president Wieslaw Rozlucki said on Friday.</p>
<p>The firm's March initial public offering of 1.5 million shares at 58 zlotys each was oversubscribed.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
